  "description": "Pure C# CHD (Compressed Hunks of Data) reader and writer library. Supports MAME CHD formats V1-V5, all 10 compression codecs (zlib, lzma, huffman, flac, zstd, avhu + CD variants), and full CHD creation/encoding with chdman-compatible output.",
