  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.5 (prepared, not yet published): ports MAME's multisession cue handling (REM SESSION / LEAD-IN / LEAD-OUT / session pregap). Single-bin IsoBuster/ImgBurn layouts trim the session's last track at the declared lead-out and turn the inter-session dummy data into zero-filled pad frames; multi-bin Redump/DiscImageCreator layouts synthesize the standard lead-in/lead-out (with the .img no-padding heuristic). Malformed lead-out values that MAME's math would turn negative are rejected with a clear error instead of being encoded as a silently wrong image. Verified byte-identical to chdman createcd on synthetic fixtures for all three layouts; suite 451/451. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
